---
description: Flutter app rules
globs: mobile/**
alwaysApply: false
---

- Feature-first: `lib/features/<feature>/{data,domain,presentation}`; shared code in `lib/core`.
- State: Riverpod providers per feature. No global singletons outside providers.
- Network: only through `dioProvider` (`core/api/api_client.dart`). Map `DioException` with
  `toApiException`; show its message, never a stack trace.
- Tokens only via `TokenStore` (secure storage). Never log tokens or phone numbers.
- Theme: colours and type only from `app/theme.dart` (mirrors `DESIGN.md`). No hard-coded colours.
- Feed is a vertical `PageView` (swipe, not scroll). Keep at most 2 video players alive.
- Every screen handles loading, empty, error and offline.
- `flutter analyze` and `flutter test` must pass; add a widget or golden test for new UI.
